{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813270/extras/580e9246f503292299cc1c7101f3d801.poster.avif?t=1756340769\" width=800 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813270/extras/580e9246f503292299cc1c7101f3d801.webm?t=1756340769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813270/extras/f731bc98914b0c6f2c1a79668ea143ec.poster.avif?t=1756340769\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813270/extras/f731bc98914b0c6f2c1a79668ea143ec.webm?t=1756340769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813270/extras/f731bc98914b0c6f2c1a79668ea143ec.mp4?t=1756340769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desperation is a challenging tactical RPG in a dark fantasy setting about conquering Desperation in a Curse ridden land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through challenging excursions to recruit companion, fight foes, and gain power through items, resources and knowledge. You will fight viscous enemies, testing your cunning and resource management through a limited adventure bag. Uncover the story of the land and why this once great kingdom has fallen to its current Curse ridden state.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813270/extras/f6114bdaff0fba99018904515180ef23.poster.avif?t=1756340769\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813270/extras/f6114bdaff0fba99018904515180ef23.webm?t=1756340769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813270/extras/7b7fe1491c61b0974dcbd0a47af4d8c6.poster.avif?t=1756340769\" width=466 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813270/extras/7b7fe1491c61b0974dcbd0a47af4d8c6.webm?t=1756340769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813270/extras/7b7fe1491c61b0974dcbd0a47af4d8c6.mp4?t=1756340769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural generation</strong> makes each Expedition unique in its route, paths, and locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows what terrible up hill battles are to come. You might find yourself in a narrow forest pathway with little choice but to face your enemy head on or you might be in a open field with several choices to plan your next move!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813270/extras/0231b15bb79ef01bb4082517e47fd71d.poster.avif?t=1756340769\" width=800 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813270/extras/0231b15bb79ef01bb4082517e47fd71d.webm?t=1756340769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813270/extras/2fe39dab1c78606a2fac030ebb0c820d.poster.avif?t=1756340769\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813270/extras/2fe39dab1c78606a2fac030ebb0c820d.webm?t=1756340769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813270/extras/2fe39dab1c78606a2fac030ebb0c820d.mp4?t=1756340769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Other Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Companions: </strong>Recruit up to three companions to assist you in your expedition. Use their talents and let them learn new ones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spatial Inventory:</strong> space is a resource, manage it wisely. The adventure bag has a limited amount of slots. Chose to bring in medical supplies or equipment for a companion you hope to find, or go in with a empty bag to have more room for loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and Trading: </strong>Use resources or gold to craft and buy items and equipment to bonus you and your companions stat. Become stronger with every step to conquer your Desperation.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3813270?t=1756340769","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3813270?t=1756340769","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813270/c800871b8f4f70a391445ba9b517a92d72245bc8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756340769","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813270/c800871b8f4f70a391445ba9b517a92d72245bc8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756340769","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The overall story goes 